    <p class="par2">I've been producing music since 2020. I first started making beats on BandLab just to learn the basics and test out different sounds. In the beginning, I was just messing around, figuring out how to put melodies and drums together, and learning what sounded good.<br><br>

After a few years, I moved over to FL Studio to take my music more seriously. Switching to FL Studio helped me level up my sound and gave me more control over my beats. Once I felt confident and knew my beats were sounding good, I started uploading them regularly on my YouTube channel so people could hear my work.</p>
